# Padrões de Teste (Vitest)

## Localização dos arquivos

Testes ficam **junto ao arquivo testado**, com sufixo `.test.ts`:

```
application/trainer/SaveMetricConfigUseCase.ts
application/trainer/SaveMetricConfigUseCase.test.ts

infrastructure/supabase/MetricConfigRepository.ts
infrastructure/supabase/MetricConfigRepository.test.ts
```

## Testes de Use Cases (application/)

Mockar repositórios como objetos simples com `vi.fn()`:

```typescript
import { describe, it, expect, vi } from "vitest";
import { GetStudentsUseCase } from "./GetStudentsUseCase";

function makeRepo(students = []) {
  return {
    getAll: vi.fn().mockResolvedValue(students),
    getById: vi.fn(),
    create: vi.fn(),
    update: vi.fn(),
    delete: vi.fn(),
  };
}

describe("GetStudentsUseCase", () => {
  it("retorna lista de alunos", async () => {
    const repo = makeRepo([{ id: "1", name: "João" }]);
    const useCase = new GetStudentsUseCase(repo);
    const result = await useCase.execute("user-1");
    expect(result).toHaveLength(1);
    expect(repo.getAll).toHaveBeenCalled();
  });
});
```

## Testes de Repositórios (infrastructure/)

Mockar o cliente Supabase com cadeia de `vi.fn()`:

```typescript
const supabase = {
  from: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({
    select: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({
      eq: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({
        order: vi.fn().mockResolvedValue({ data: [dbRow], error: null }),
      }),
    }),
  }),
};
const repo = new SupabaseStudentRepository(supabase, userId);
```

Para `upsert` / `insert` / `update`:

```typescript
const single = vi.fn().mockResolvedValue({ data: dbRow, error: null });
const supabase = {
  from: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({
    upsert: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({ select: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({ single }) }),
  }),
};
```

## Testes de Value Objects e Serviços de Domínio (domain/)

Sem mocks — são funções/classes puras:

```typescript
import { MetricWeight } from "./MetricWeight";

it("rejeita peso maior que 3", () => {
  expect(() => new MetricWeight(3.1)).toThrow();
});
```

## Cobertura

Configurada em `vitest.config.ts` para `domain/**`, `application/**`, `infrastructure/**`.
Não reduzir os thresholds existentes.

## Imports

Usar alias `@/` configurado no projeto:

```typescript
import { Student } from "@/lib/types";
import { GetStudentsUseCase } from "@/application/student/GetStudentsUseCase";
```
